   *    - 151 ppm to 250 ppm: 1
   *    - 101 ppm to 150 ppm: 2
   *    - 76 ppm to 100 ppm: 3
   *    - 51 ppm to 75 ppm: 4
   *    - 31 ppm to 50 ppm: 5
   *    - 21 ppm to 30 ppm: 6
   *    - 0 ppm to 20 ppm: 7
